{"id":"2d4eceffa0456d11","group":"58","path":"58/batch02/58-thm-sacks.md","title":"Sacks Forcing","display":"thm-sacks — Sacks Forcing","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-thm-sacks","aliases":["58-thm-sacks"],"display":"thm-sacks — Sacks Forcing","depends_on":["[[../batch16/58-df-sacks.md]]","[[../batch15/58-df-forcing.md]]","[[../batch14/58-df-transitive-model-cardinals.md]]","[[58-ax-zfc.md]]","[[../batch12/58-df-transitive-set.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-thm-sacks"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-thm-sacks</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-sacks — Sacks Forcing"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"5cc89ecc0cfe69f5\" href=\"?note=5cc89ecc0cfe69f5\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-sacks.md\">../batch16/58-df-sacks.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"d06ac5a66d69d291\" href=\"?note=d06ac5a66d69d291\" title=\"../batch15/58-df-forcing.md\">../batch15/58-df-forcing.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"04828fe2ae3e423e\" href=\"?note=04828fe2ae3e423e\" title=\"../batch14/58-df-transitive-model-cardinals.md\">../batch14/58-df-transitive-model-cardinals.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc.md\">58-ax-zfc.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"c14ba496c480dcd6\" href=\"?note=c14ba496c480dcd6\" title=\"../batch12/58-df-transitive-set.md\">../batch12/58-df-transitive-set.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma,M,G,\\mathbb S,\\leq_{\\mathbb S},N,s\\in V\">\\(\\Gamma,M,G,\\mathbb S,\\leq_{\\mathbb S},N,s\\in V\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZFC}\\subseteq\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\mathcal L_\\in)\">\\(\\mathrm{ZFC}\\subseteq\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\mathcal L_\\in)\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SacksPosetInModel}_S(\\mathbb S,\\leq_{\\mathbb S},M)\">\\(\\mathrm{SacksPosetInModel}_S(\\mathbb S,\\leq_{\\mathbb S},M)\\)</span> 由下式定义；全环境的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SacksPoset}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{SacksPoset}_S\\)</span> 保持不变，强迫使用 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\">\\(M\\)</span> 中的完美树。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ForcingSetup}_S(M,\\Gamma,\\mathbb S,\\leq_{\\mathbb S},G)\">\\(\\operatorname{ForcingSetup}_S(M,\\Gamma,\\mathbb S,\\leq_{\\mathbb S},G)\\)</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\">\\(M\\)</span> 为关于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\">\\(\\Gamma\\)</span> 的可数传递模型且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\\subseteq\\mathbb S\">\\(G\\subseteq\\mathbb S\\)</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\">\\(M\\)</span>-generic 滤子（see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"d06ac5a66d69d291\" href=\"?note=d06ac5a66d69d291\" title=\"../batch15/58-df-forcing.md\">../batch15/58-df-forcing.md</a>）</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Name}(\\dot x,\\mathbb S)\">\\(\\mathrm{Name}(\\dot x,\\mathbb S)\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{val}_{G,\\mathbb S}(\\dot x)\">\\(\\operatorname{val}_{G,\\mathbb S}(\\dot x)\\)</span> 是上游强迫名及其赋值接口</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SacksStem}_S\\subseteq V^2\">\\(\\mathrm{SacksStem}_S\\subseteq V^2\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SacksGenericReal}_S\\subseteq V^2\">\\(\\mathrm{SacksGenericReal}_S\\subseteq V^2\\)</span> 是本文件定义的树干及泛型实数谓词</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SacksPreservesOmegaOne}_{\\mathsf{meta}}\">\\(\\mathrm{SacksPreservesOmegaOne}_{\\mathsf{meta}}\\)</span> 使用 <code>58-df-transitive-model-cardinals</code> 中显式限定双射见证属于模型的定义。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L_\\in\">\\(\\mathcal L_\\in\\)</span> 为该文件固定的成员语言。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>外部接口 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{TransitiveSet}\">\\(\\mathrm{TransitiveSet}\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"c14ba496c480dcd6\" href=\"?note=c14ba496c480dcd6\" title=\"../batch12/58-df-transitive-set.md\">../batch12/58-df-transitive-set.md</a> 的同名定义与参数次序。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}sacks\\text{-}stem}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{SacksStem}_S(s,T)\\leftrightarrow\nT\\subseteq2^{&lt;\\omega}\n\\land s\\in T\n\\land\\forall t\\in T\\;(s\\subseteq t\\lor t\\subseteq s)\n\\land\\forall u\\in T\\;\\Bigl(\n\\forall t\\in T\\;(u\\subseteq t\\lor t\\subseteq u)\n\\to u\\subseteq s\n\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}sacks\\text{-}stem}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{SacksStem}_S(s,T)\\leftrightarrow\nT\\subseteq2^{&lt;\\omega}\n\\land s\\in T\n\\land\\forall t\\in T\\;(s\\subseteq t\\lor t\\subseteq s)\n\\land\\forall u\\in T\\;\\Bigl(\n\\forall t\\in T\\;(u\\subseteq t\\lor t\\subseteq u)\n\\to u\\subseteq s\n\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}sacks\\text{-}generic\\text{-}real}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{SacksGenericReal}_S(s,G)\\leftrightarrow\ns=\\bigcup\\Bigl\\{u\\in2^{&lt;\\omega}:\\exists T\\in G\\;\\mathrm{SacksStem}_S(u,T)\\Bigr\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}sacks\\text{-}generic\\text{-}real}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{SacksGenericReal}_S(s,G)\\leftrightarrow\ns=\\bigcup\\Bigl\\{u\\in2^{&lt;\\omega}:\\exists T\\in G\\;\\mathrm{SacksStem}_S(u,T)\\Bigr\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}sacks}\\vdash_{\\mathsf{meta}}\n\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{ZFC}\\subseteq\\Gamma\n\\land\\mathrm{SacksPosetInModel}_S(\\mathbb S,\\leq_{\\mathbb S},M)\n\\land\\operatorname{ForcingSetup}_S(M,\\Gamma,\\mathbb S,\\leq_{\\mathbb S},G)\n\\land N=\\{\\operatorname{val}_{G,\\mathbb S}(\\dot x):\\dot x\\in M\\land\\mathrm{Name}(\\dot x,\\mathbb S)\\}\n\\land\\mathrm{SacksGenericReal}_S(s,G)\n\\Bigr)\n\\to\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{SacksPreservesOmegaOne}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(M,N)\n\\land s\\in2^\\omega\n\\land s\\notin M\n\\Bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}sacks}\\vdash_{\\mathsf{meta}}\n\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{ZFC}\\subseteq\\Gamma\n\\land\\mathrm{SacksPosetInModel}_S(\\mathbb S,\\leq_{\\mathbb S},M)\n\\land\\operatorname{ForcingSetup}_S(M,\\Gamma,\\mathbb S,\\leq_{\\mathbb S},G)\n\\land N=\\{\\operatorname{val}_{G,\\mathbb S}(\\dot x):\\dot x\\in M\\land\\mathrm{Name}(\\dot x,\\mathbb S)\\}\n\\land\\mathrm{SacksGenericReal}_S(s,G)\n\\Bigr)\n\\to\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{SacksPreservesOmegaOne}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(M,N)\n\\land s\\in2^\\omega\n\\land s\\notin M\n\\Bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{SacksPosetInModel}_S(P,R,M)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{TransitiveSet}_S(M)\\land P,R\\in M\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\exists\\mathbb S,\\leq_{\\mathbb S}\\in V\\;\n\\bigl(\\mathrm{SacksPoset}_S(\\mathbb S,\\leq_{\\mathbb S})\n\\land P=\\mathbb S\\cap M\n\\land R={\\leq_{\\mathbb S}}\\cap(P\\times P)\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{SacksPosetInModel}_S(P,R,M)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{TransitiveSet}_S(M)\\land P,R\\in M\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\exists\\mathbb S,\\leq_{\\mathbb S}\\in V\\;\n\\bigl(\\mathrm{SacksPoset}_S(\\mathbb S,\\leq_{\\mathbb S})\n\\land P=\\mathbb S\\cap M\n\\land R={\\leq_{\\mathbb S}}\\cap(P\\times P)\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The assertion states the two claims externally about the set-coded generic extension; it does not use an unselected <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M[G]\\models-\">\\(M[G]\\models-\\)</span> relation.</li>\n<li>Sacks forcing preserves cardinals and adds a new real.</li>\n<li>它是 proper 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega^\\omega\">\\(\\omega^\\omega\\)</span>-bounding，并具有 Sacks 性质；但它确实新增实数，因此“完全不新增序数的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega\">\\(\\omega\\)</span>-序列”是自相矛盾的说法。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch16/58-df-sacks.md","status":"resolved","id":"5cc89ecc0cfe69f5","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-sacks.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch15/58-df-forcing.md","status":"resolved","id":"d06ac5a66d69d291","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch15/58-df-forcing.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch14/58-df-transitive-model-cardinals.md","status":"resolved","id":"04828fe2ae3e423e","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch14/58-df-transitive-model-cardinals.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-ax-zfc.md","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch12/58-df-transitive-set.md","status":"resolved","id":"c14ba496c480dcd6","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch12/58-df-transitive-set.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch15/58-df-forcing.md","status":"resolved","id":"d06ac5a66d69d291","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{ForcingSetup}_S(M,\\Gamma,\\mathbb S,\\leq_{\\mathbb S},G)$，故 $M$ 为关于 $\\Gamma$ 的可数传递模型且 $G\\subseteq\\mathbb S$ 为 $M$-generic 滤子（see [[../batch15/58-df-forcing.md]]）","embed":false},{"target":"../batch12/58-df-transitive-set.md","status":"resolved","id":"c14ba496c480dcd6","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"外部接口 $\\mathrm{TransitiveSet}$ 取 [[../batch12/58-df-transitive-set.md]] 的同名定义与参数次序。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\Gamma,M,G,\\mathbb S,\\leq_{\\mathbb S},N,s\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZFC}\\subseteq\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\mathcal L_\\in)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{SacksPosetInModel}_S(\\mathbb S,\\leq_{\\mathbb S},M)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{SacksPoset}_S","display":false},{"tex":"M","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{ForcingSetup}_S(M,\\Gamma,\\mathbb S,\\leq_{\\mathbb S},G)","display":false},{"tex":"M","display":false},{"tex":"\\Gamma","display":false},{"tex":"G\\subseteq\\mathbb S","display":false},{"tex":"M","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Name}(\\dot x,\\mathbb S)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{val}_{G,\\mathbb S}(\\dot x)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{SacksStem}_S\\subseteq V^2","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{SacksGenericReal}_S\\subseteq V^2","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{SacksPreservesOmegaOne}_{\\mathsf{meta}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal L_\\in","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{TransitiveSet}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}sacks\\text{-}stem}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{SacksStem}_S(s,T)\\leftrightarrow\nT\\subseteq2^{<\\omega}\n\\land s\\in T\n\\land\\forall t\\in T\\;(s\\subseteq t\\lor t\\subseteq s)\n\\land\\forall u\\in T\\;\\Bigl(\n\\forall t\\in T\\;(u\\subseteq t\\lor t\\subseteq u)\n\\to u\\subseteq s\n\\Bigr)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}sacks\\text{-}generic\\text{-}real}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{SacksGenericReal}_S(s,G)\\leftrightarrow\ns=\\bigcup\\Bigl\\{u\\in2^{<\\omega}:\\exists T\\in G\\;\\mathrm{SacksStem}_S(u,T)\\Bigr\\}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}sacks}\\vdash_{\\mathsf{meta}}\n\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{ZFC}\\subseteq\\Gamma\n\\land\\mathrm{SacksPosetInModel}_S(\\mathbb S,\\leq_{\\mathbb S},M)\n\\land\\operatorname{ForcingSetup}_S(M,\\Gamma,\\mathbb S,\\leq_{\\mathbb S},G)\n\\land N=\\{\\operatorname{val}_{G,\\mathbb S}(\\dot x):\\dot x\\in M\\land\\mathrm{Name}(\\dot x,\\mathbb S)\\}\n\\land\\mathrm{SacksGenericReal}_S(s,G)\n\\Bigr)\n\\to\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{SacksPreservesOmegaOne}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(M,N)\n\\land s\\in2^\\omega\n\\land s\\notin M\n\\Bigr).","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{SacksPosetInModel}_S(P,R,M)\\leftrightarrow{}&\n\\mathrm{TransitiveSet}_S(M)\\land P,R\\in M\\\\\n&\\land\\exists\\mathbb S,\\leq_{\\mathbb S}\\in V\\;\n\\bigl(\\mathrm{SacksPoset}_S(\\mathbb S,\\leq_{\\mathbb S})\n\\land P=\\mathbb S\\cap M\n\\land R={\\leq_{\\mathbb S}}\\cap(P\\times P)\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"M[G]\\models-","display":false},{"tex":"\\omega^\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\omega","display":false}],"bytes":3150,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-4400","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-thm-sacks.md|58-thm-sacks]]（batch02）"}],"outgoing":["5cc89ecc0cfe69f5","d06ac5a66d69d291","04828fe2ae3e423e","a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","c14ba496c480dcd6"]}